Author: Clément Boudereau <cboudereau@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Mar 26 17:54:00 2026 +0100

    feat(otlp-migration): step 4c — span_metrics transform (pipeline telemetry)
    
    Add span_metrics transform that computes RED (Rate, Errors, Duration) metrics
    from OTel spans, mirroring the OTel Collector Contrib spanmetricsconnector.
    
    Features:
    - Aggregates spans by configurable dimensions into calls (Sum) + duration (Histogram)
    - Default dimensions: service.name, span.name, span.kind, status.code
    - User-configurable extra dimensions from span/resource attributes
    - Configurable: namespace, aggregation temporality, flush interval,
      histogram buckets and unit (s/ms), exclude_dimensions
    - Periodic flush emits OtelMetric events
    
    6 unit tests: single span, aggregation, dimension separation, custom
    dimensions, flush reset, error status as dimension.
    
    Completes Step 4 — the full 3-tier deployment story:
    - 4a: Load-balancing sink (consistent hash, resolvers)
    - 4b: Tail sampling transform (8 policy types)
    - 4c: Pipeline telemetry (span_metrics)

