commit 7f0ac6ef698cfc7df5c1c13e8436dcd0e300df39
Author: Clément Boudereau <cboudereau@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Mar 13 19:03:03 2026 +0100

    feat: ship VRL migration tool (vector vrl-migrate)
    
    Three-pass text rewriter that migrates VRL programs from Vector field
    semantics to OTel field semantics:
    
    - Pass 1: Structural rewrites (LOG-01..07, META-01..02) — .message→.,
      .timestamp→.time_unix_nano, .host→.resource.attributes."host.name",
      .tags.<key>→.attributes."<key>", .level→.severity_text, etc.
    - Pass 2: Semantic rewrites (SEM-01..07) — context-sensitive patterns
      like exists(.message)→true, parse_json(.)→parse_json(string!(.)),
      del(.message)→REVIEW.
    - Pass 3: Metric rewrites (MET-02..07) — .namespace, .kind (REVIEW),
      .value.counter.value→.data_points[0].as_double, etc.
    
    CLI modes: --in-place, --diff, --config (inline VRL in TOML configs).
    29 unit tests covering all rules, edge cases, and string/comment safety.

